       <a class=\"breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/en/education\">\n                            <span class=\"breadcrumb__link-text\">Education</span>\n            </a>\n                                \n\n<svg class=\"icon icon--chevron icon--small \" focusable=\"false\">\n  <use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\n       href=\"/themes/custom/ru/dist/icons/defs/svg/sprite.defs.svg?t=1795028415#chevron\"></use>\n</svg>\n                  </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\">\n                      <a class=\"breadcrumb__link\" href=\"/en/education/scholarships\">\n                            <span class=\"breadcrumb__link-text\">Scholarships</span>\n            </a>\n                                \n\n<svg class=\"icon icon--chevron icon--small \" focusable=\"false\">\n  <use xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"\n       href=\"/themes/custom/ru/dist/icons/defs/svg/sprite.defs.svg?t=1795028415#chevron\"></use>\n</svg>\n                  </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\">\n                      <span class=\"breadcrumb__current\">VSBfonds</span>\n                            </li>\n          </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n    \n  \n\n                  \n        \n        \n        \n\n\n\n  \n    <div class=\"region region--content\">\n      \n\n\n<div id=\"block-ru-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n            \n                \n                <div  class=\"node node--type-grant node--view-mode-full node--full\">\n  \n\n  \n                \n    \n          \n    \n      \n  \n            <div class=\"l-node-top\">\n        \n\n  \n  \n          <h1>\n  VSBfonds\n</h1>\n\n    \n  \n\n\n                                </div>\n      \n  \n    \n        \n    <div class=\"l-node-content\">\n        \n\n      <div class=\"article-body\">\n            <p>VSBfonds annually awards scholarships to students who wish to do a complete study programme abroad, after they have finished their study programme at Radboud University.&nbsp;</p><p>The VSBfonds is for students with the Dutch nationality. Please refer to the <a href=\"https://www.ru.nl/opleidingen/studiebeurzen/vsbfonds-beurs\">Dutch page</a> for more information.</p>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  <dl class=\"definitionlist definitionlist--bg\">\n            <div class=\"definitionlist__item\">\n        <dt>\n          Type \n        </dt>\n        <dd>\n                    Scholarship\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n                <div class=\"definitionlist__item\">\n        <dt>\n          Eligible countries or regions \n        </dt>\n        <dd>\n                    All EU/EEA countries, All non-EU/non-EEA countries\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n                <div class=\"definitionlist__item\">\n        <dt>\n          Duration of scholarship \n        </dt>\n        <dd>\n                    3 to 24 months\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n                <div class=\"definitionlist__item\">\n        <dt>\n          Maximum financing \n        </dt>\n        <dd>\n                    \u20ac10.000\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n                <div class=\"definitionlist__item\">\n        <dt>\n          Coverage of scholarship \n        </dt>\n        <dd>\n                    Partial scholarship\n        </dd>\n      </div>\n      </dl>\n\n  \n\n      <div class=\"field rich-text rich-text--field-grant-conditions\">\n\n          <span class=\"field__label\">Conditions</span>\n    \n          <p>To be eligible for a VSBfonds grant, you must meet a number of requirements:</p><ul><li>you are a full-time student graduating as Bachelor or Master</li><li>your graduation date is between 1 March 2025 and 31 December 2027</li><li>you have the Dutch nationality</li><li>you are highly motivated in terms of your personal and social aspirations, which is more important than grades</li></ul><p>Please note that it is not possible to use this grant for an internship or research project.&nbsp;</p><p><a class=\"btn btn--primary\" href=\"https://www.vsbfonds.nl/studiebeurzen/hbowo/voor-wie\">More information can be found on the VSB site (only in Dutch)</a></p>\n    \n    </div>\n  \n\n\n      <div class=\"field field--label-title field--name-field-how-to-apply field--label-above rich-text\">\n      <h2 class=\"field__label\">How to apply</h2>\n\n                  <p>More information about the VSBfonds study grants, the conditions and the application procedure can be found on the VSBfonds <a href=\"http://www.vsbfonds.nl/beurzen\" title=\"website\">website</a>.&nbsp;</p><h3>Deadline is: <strong>1 March 2027</strong></h3><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h2><strong>More information and contact</strong></h2><p><strong>Want to know more? Every faculty has a special contact person:</strong></p><ul><li>Faculty of Philosophy, Theology and Religious Studies: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">internationaloffice</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">ftr.ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Roos de Huu)</span></span></li><li>Faculty of Arts: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">internationaloffice</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">let.ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Treja Wilkens)</span></span></li><li>Nijmegen School of &nbsp;Management: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">k.schilders</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">fm.ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Koen Schilders)</span></span></li><li>Faculty of Medical Science: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">internationalofficestudents</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">radboudumc.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Cindy van Dijk)</span></span></li><li>Faculty of Science: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">io</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">science.ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Hub Nijssen)</span></span></li><li>Faculty of Law: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">internationaloffice</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">jur.ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Kim Gildeman)</span></span></li><li>Faculty of Social Sciences: <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">ioss</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (Patrick Beckers, Miranda Smeeman)</span></span></li></ul><p>For general questions: send an email to <span class=\"spamspan\"><span class=\"u\">vsbfonds</span> [at] <span class=\"d\">ru.nl</span><span class=\"t\"> (vsbfonds[at]ru[dot]nl)</span></span> , Lonneke van Maasakkers-Hijl and Nicole Moed, working at <a href=\"/en/departments/student-affairs/student-life-and-international-mobility\" data-entity-type=\"taxonomy_term\" data-entity-uuid=\"7c793224-31e5-4ec5-b9b1-5259286830bb\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\">Student Life and International Mobility</a>, &nbsp;</p>\n            \n  </div>\n\n      <div class=\"field field__org\">\n      <h2 class=\"field__label\">\n        Organisation involved\n      </h2>\n      <div class=\"logo\">\n        <div class=\"field__logo\">\n\n<figure class=\"image image--image image--logo\">\n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n            <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/styles/logo/public/2024-09/VSBfonds%20logo%20kleur.jpg.webp?itok=P_szUTNm\" width=\"238\" height=\"53\" alt=\"VSBfonds\" />\n\n\n\n    \n  \n\n\n</figure>\n</div>\n              </div>\n    </div>\n  \n\n                                          \n                                    \n      \n                                </div>\n\n      \n                        </div>\n\n\n    </div>\n\n\n    </div>\n  \n\n\n        </div>          </main>\n\n\n    \n      </div>\n\n  \n\n      <div class=\"l-footer-wrapper\">\n      <footer class=\"l-footer\">\n        \n\n\n\n  \n    <div class=\"region region--footer_col_1\">\n      <nav role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"block-section-aware-footer-menu-en-menu\" id=\"block-section-aware-footer-menu-en\">\n            \n  <h2 class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"block-section-aware-footer-menu-en-menu\">Footer menu [EN]</h2>\n  \n\n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <ul region=\"footer_col_1\" class=\"menu\">\n\n      \n                        \n          \